@startuml
actor Operator
participant "Tkinter Presenter" as UI
participant "FastAPI Handler" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB
Operator -> UI : confirm online
UI -> UI : persist key + payload in SQLite
UI -> API : POST command + version + key
API -> DB : BEGIN / serialize key
API -> DB : check grant, lock documents / periods / locations
API -> DB : lock items / balances / reservations
alt invalid permission, state or insufficient quantity
 API -> DB : ROLLBACK
 API --> UI : typed error; keep input
else valid
 API -> DB : ledger + balance + reservation + audit + outbox + result
 API -> DB : COMMIT
 API --> UI : committed result
end
alt response lost
 UI -> API : GET operation using original key
 API --> UI : saved result or NOT_FOUND
 note over UI,API : Retry only same key and execution_key; never a new key for UNKNOWN.
end
@enduml
